# v27.0 · episode 4 chapter 4: ITS MUSIC, as it is asked of ElevenLabs Music v2.5 (eleven_music_v2_5, the newest),
# instrumental. A row: (name, seconds, takes, the prompt, where it is heard). Every cue is a measured pick until Chad's
# ear (loudness-matched previews of each candidate go to him: v10.6). The trance's cue follows research note R-A's brief
